Package: miadi-music-wheels-cp311
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3 (<< 3.12)
Maintainer: Miadi <mia@jgwill.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jgwill/miadi-orchestration-kit
Description: NumPy, SciPy and Pillow wheels for Python 3.11, for miadi-music-measure
 The pinned wheels miadi-music-measure builds its venv from, for a host whose
 python3 is 3.11 (Debian 12). It depends on that python3, so apt installs only the
 set the host can use; miadi-music-measure accepts any one of them. Each set is
 its own package so that none exceeds the apt repository's 100 MB limit.
